],"metadata":{"title":"Boise now requiring licensing, insurance for electric vehicle popular with youth","source":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/07/01/boise-now-requiring-licensing-insurance-for-electric-vehicle-popular-with-youth/?utm_source=boisedev-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=boisedev-am","author":["[[Erin Banks Rusby - BoiseDev Reporter]]"],"published":"2026-07-01","created":"2026-07-07","description":"The Boise City Council voted earlier this week to regulate the use of what city council members are calling a popular but dangerous type of electric vehicle. The council approved an ordinance distinguishing e-motorcycles, sometimes called e-motos, from e-bikes, and specifying licensing requirements for the use of e-motorcycles in the city. Under the ordinance, an […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},